    "counter": "A shop's counter has one skill slot open; skulls unlock a 'service' slot (blood services) or a 'consumable' slot, one per shop (SHOP UPGRADE tooltip 'UNLOCK SLOT / PERMANENTLY ADD A 'SERVICE' SLOT TO THIS SHOP' [rec2 f0182], 'CONSUMABLE' [rec2 f1141]) [wiki]",
