    "blood_services": "Priced in hearts (HP): REROLL 'BLOOD SERVICE / REROLL AND RESTOCK THIS SHOP' for 1, then 2 [rec2 f0185, f0457]; 'Blood Exchange' gains 5 coins for 2 HP [wiki] (1 on SALE [rec2 review])"
